<title>CANADA: Saputo won't raise Ault bid.</title>
<headline>Saputo won't raise Ault bid.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saputo Group said on Thursday it would not raise its C$28 a share hostile bid for Ault Foods Ltd and instead would tender its 16.3 percent stake to white knight Parmalat Finanziaria SpA of Italy.</p>
<p>Privately held Montreal-based cheesemaker Saputo said it reviewed the confidential information in Ault's data room and would not top Parmalat's C$34 a share offer.</p>
<p>Saputo's bid was due to expire on July 7.</p>
</text>
